i Kouhai no Inochi no Onjin ni Nattara, Kayoi-zuma ni Natte Kankei o Sematte Kuru."},"altTitles":[{"en":"After I Saved the Cutest Underclassman at School, She Started Coming Over Like My Wife and Pushing for a Relationship"},{"ja":"\u5b66\u5712\u4e00\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044\u5f8c\u8f29\u306e\u547d\u306e\u6069\u4eba\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3001\u901a\u3044\u59bb\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u95a2\u4fc2\u3092\u8feb\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308b\u3002"}],"description":{"en":"\u201cI came here to look after you, Senpai!\u201d\n\nWhy is the cutest girl in school at my house?!\n\nI'm Tomoya Mido, a second-year high school student. One day, I rescued Yuika Shirasu, a beautiful first-year student who's become the talk of the school and beyond, from a traffic accident.\n\nHoping to avoid any more trouble, I left the scene and headed home\u2014only to find her standing right outside my front door.\n\nAs it turned out, Yuika was my fianc\u00e9e, a match arranged by our parents!\n\nAnd after seeing that I'd injured my right arm saving her, she declared that she'd become my visiting wife and look after me!\n\nAnd so began our semi-cohabitation.\n\nThe curtain rises on a sweet romantic comedy about an innocent yet bold underclassman who's determined to play the role of her senpai's wife!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"nu":"if-i-become-the-lifesaver-of-the-single-most-adorable-kouhai-in-the-academy-she-becomes-a-commuting-wife-and-comes-pressing-for-a-relationship","mal":"198130","raw":"https:\/\/piccoma.com\/web\/product\/221241?etype=episode"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"descriptio